1
00:00:00,396 --> 00:00:02,486
(Sheldon:)Who is it?

2
00:00:04,442 --> 00:00:07,942
(Sheldon:)Oh, hello, Penny. It's open. Come in.

3
00:00:10,323 --> 00:00:12,363
(Sheldon:)Sarcasm.

4
00:00:13,618 --> 00:00:16,658
- Well, they're all still up there.
- You think I can't hear them?

5
00:00:16,871 --> 00:00:19,961
(Sheldon:)Listen to that. Stomp, stomp, stomp.

6
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:23,626
It's Wolowitz in his stacked heels
that fool no one.

7
00:00:24,879 --> 00:00:27,759
(Penny:)I don't even know why I care.
I don't care.

8
00:00:27,965 --> 00:00:31,765
(Penny:)All right, I cared enough to memorize
that stupid joke, but that's all I care.

9
00:00:32,804 --> 00:00:33,934
(Sheldon:)You know, Penny...

10
00:00:34,138 --> 00:00:37,728
(Sheldon:)...there's something that occurs in beehives
you might find interesting.

11
00:00:37,892 --> 00:00:43,102
(Sheldon:)Occasionally, a new queen will arrive
while the old queen is still in power.

12
00:00:43,314 --> 00:00:47,404
(Sheldon:)When this happens, the old queen
must either locate to a new hive...

13
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:53,570
(Sheldon:)...or engage in a battle to the death
until only one queen remains.

14
00:00:55,284 --> 00:00:57,914
What are you saying?
That I'm threatened by Alicia?

15
00:00:58,079 --> 00:01:02,019
(Penny:)That I'm like the old queen of the hive,
and it's just time for me to go?

